{"id": "9d920aba-5087-4628-a8ab-2d150596dff9", "slug": "dimensional-interface-schema", "title": "Dimensional Interface Schema", "description": "Dimensional Interface Dashboard Section is designed for demonstrating application workflows and interface hierarchy. Key features include clear information density, modular panels, and interface rhythm. It is suitable for product showcases, admin panels, and analytics experiences.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-staff-featured-2026-05-22\"\nname: \"Dimensional Interface Schema\"\ndescription: \"Dimensional Interface Dashboard Section is designed for demonstrating application workflows and interface hierarchy. Key features include clear information density, modular panels, and interface rhythm. It is suitable for product showcases, admin panels, and analytics experiences.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#3B82F6\"\n  secondary: \"#18181B\"\n  accent: \"#10B981\"\n  background: \"#18181B\"\n  surface: \"#E4E4E7\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#A1A1AA\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"16px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Dimensional Interface Schema\nSource: Neuform staff featured templates. Author: Sourany Phomhome (@sou). Views: 75; favorites: 6; remixes: 0.\nTags: dashboard, animated, webgl, threejs, bento, dither, charts, navigation.\n## Overview\nDimensional Interface Dashboard Section is designed for demonstrating application workflows and interface hierarchy. Key features include clear information density, modular panels, and interface rhythm. It is suitable for product showcases, admin panels, and analytics experiences.\n\nNexus Architecture Visualizer Documentation Deploy Schema Introducing Dimensional Mode Intelligence that feels alive and infinite. Move beyond flat dashboards into a fluid, dimensional space where your schema breathes.…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Intelligence that feels alive and infinite.; Architecture without compromise.; Sub-millisecond sync; Cryptographic integrity; Ready to see the unseen?.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #3B82F6, secondary #18181B, accent #10B981, background #18181B, surface #E4E4E7, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nDashboard, chart, and data panels should preserve their compact operational hierarchy, nested surfaces, and metric emphasis.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"scroll-smooth\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Dimensional Interface Schema</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-zinc-50 text-zinc-900 font-sans antialiased overflow-x-hidden selection:bg-zinc-200\">\n\n    <!-- Cinematic Background Elements -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 z-[-1] pointer-events-none\">\n        <!-- Aura Asset Background -->\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[url('https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/4734259a-bad7-422f-981e-ce01e79184f2_1600w.jpg')] bg-cover bg-center opacity-[0.15] blur-[80px] mix-blend-multiply\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-white/60 via-white/90 to-zinc-50/95\"></div>\n        <!-- Fine Noise Overlay -->\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.03]\" style=\"background-image: url('data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox=%220 0 200 200%22 xmlns=%22http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%22%3E%3Cfilter id=%22noiseFilter%22%3E%3CfeTurbulence type=%22fractalNoise%22 baseFrequency=%220.65%22 numOctaves=%223%22 stitchTiles=%22stitch%22/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width=%22100%25%22 height=%22100%25%22 filter=%22url(%23noiseFilter)%22/%3E%3C/svg%3E');\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Minimal Navigation -->\n    <nav class=\"fixed top-0 left-0 right-0 z-50 px-6 py-4 flex items-center justify-between bg-white/40 backdrop-blur-md border-b border-zinc-200/50\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 font-medium tracking-tight text-sm\">\n            <div class=\"w-6 h-6 bg-zinc-900 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center\">\n                <div class=\"w-2 h-2 bg-white rounded-full\"></div>\n            </div>\n            Nexus\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-8 text-sm font-medium text-zinc-500\">\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-zinc-900 transition-colors\">Architecture</a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-zinc-900 transition-colors\">Visualizer</a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-zinc-900 transition-colors\">Documentation</a>\n        </div>\n        <button class=\"bg-zinc-900 text-white text-sm font-medium px-4 py-2 rounded-full hover:bg-zinc-800 transition-colors shadow-sm\">\n            Deploy Schema\n        </button>\n    </nav>\n\n    <!-- Hero Section with Masked Reveal & 3D Schema -->\n    <main class=\"relative pt-40 pb-20 overflow-hidden\">\n\n        <!-- Typography Header -->\n        <header class=\"relative z-20 px-6 max-w-5xl mx-auto text-center flex flex-col items-center\">\n            <div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white/80 border border-zinc-200 shadow-sm text-xs font-medium text-zinc-600 mb-8 backdrop-blur-sm\">\n                <span class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-blue-500 animate-pulse\"></span>\n                Introducing Dimensional Mode\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- GSAP Masked Reveal Container -->\n            <h1 class=\"text-5xl md:text-7xl font-medium tracking-tight text-zinc-900 leading-[1.05] flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-x-[0.3em] gap-y-2 mb-6\">\n                <span class=\"inline-flex overflow-hidden pb-2\"><span class=\"masked-word translate-y-[110%] will-change-transform inline-block\">Intelligence</span></span>\n                <span class=\"inline-flex overflow-hidden pb-2\"><span class=\"masked-word translate-y-[110%] will-change-transform inline-block\">that</span></span>\n                <span class=\"inline-flex overflow-hidden pb-2\"><span class=\"masked-word translate-y-[110%] will-change-transform inline-block\">feels</span></span>\n                <span class=\"w-full hidden md:block\"></span>\n                <span class=\"inline-flex overflow-hidden pb-2\"><span class=\"masked-word translate-y-[110%] will-change-transform inline-block\">alive</span></span>\n                <span class=\"inline-flex overflow-hidden pb-2\"><span class=\"masked-word translate-y-[110%] will-change-transform inline-block\">and</span></span>\n                <span class=\"inline-flex overflow-hidden pb-2\"><span class=\"masked-word translate-y-[110%] text-zinc-400 will-change-transform inline-block\">infinite.</span></span>\n            </h1>\n\n            <p class=\"text-lg text-zinc-500 max-w-2xl mx-auto flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-x-1\">\n                <span class=\"inline-flex overflow-hidden pb-1\"><span class=\"masked-word translate-y-[110%] will-change-transform inline-block\">Move</span></span>\n                <span class=\"inline-flex overflow-hidden pb-1\"><span class=\"masked-word translate-y-[110%] will-change-transform inline-block\">beyond</span></span>\n                <span class=\"inline-flex overflow-hidden pb-1\"><span class=\"masked-word translate-y-[110%] will-change-transform inline-block\">flat</span></span>\n                <span class=\"inline-flex overflow-hidden pb-1\"><span class=\"masked-word translate-y-[110%] will-change-transform inline-block\">dashboards</span></span>\n                <span class=\"inline-flex overflow-hidden pb-1\"><span class=\"masked-word translate-y-[110%] will-change-transform inline-block\">into</span></span>\n                <span class=\"inline-flex overflow-hidden pb-1\"><span class=\"masked-word translate-y-[110%] will-change-transform inline-block\">a</span></span>\n                <span class=\"inline-flex overflow-hidden pb-1\"><span class=\"masked-word translate-y-[110%] will-change-transform inline-block\">fluid,</span></span>\n                <span class=\"inline-flex overflow-hidden pb-1\"><span class=\"masked-word translate-y-[110%] will-change-transform inline-block\">dimensional</span></span>\n                <span class=\"inline-flex overflow-hidden pb-1\"><span class=\"masked-word translate-y-[110%] will-change-transform inline-block\">space</span></span>\n                <span class=\"inline-flex overflow-hidden pb-1\"><span class=\"masked-word translate-y-[110%] will-change-transform inline-block\">where</span></span>\n                <span class=\"inline-flex overflow-hidden pb-1\"><span class=\"masked-word translate-y-[110%] will-change-transform inline-block\">your</span></span>\n                <span class=\"inline-flex overflow-hidden pb-1\"><span class=\"masked-word translate-y-[110%] will-change-transform inline-block\">schema</span></span>\n                <span class=\"inline-flex overflow-hidden pb-1\"><span class=\"masked-word translate-y-[110%] will-change-transform inline-block text-zinc-900 font-medium\">breathes.</span></span>\n            </p>\n        </header>\n\n        <!-- The WebGL-Inspired Interactive 3D Schema -->\n        <div class=\"relative w-full h-[600px] md:h-[900px] mt-12 flex items-center justify-center scene-container\" style=\"perspective: 2000px;\">\n\n            <!-- Scale wrapper for responsiveness while preserving precise absolute coordinate grid -->\n            <div class=\"transform scale-[0.45] sm:scale-[0.6] md:scale-[0.8] lg:scale-100 flex items-center justify-center will-change-transform pointer-events-none\">\n\n                <!-- The 3D Rotating Plane -->\n                <div id=\"schema-plane\" class=\"relative w-[1000px] h-[1000px] will-change-transform\" style=\"transform-style: preserve-3d; transform: rotateX(60deg) rotateZ(-45deg);\">\n\n                    <!-- Base Glass Plate & Grid -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-white/30 rounded-[4rem] border-[2px] border-white/60 shadow-[0_100px_100px_-50px_rgba(0,0,0,0.05)] overflow-hidden\" style=\"transform: translateZ(-2px);\">\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.15]\" style=\"background-image: linear-gradient(to right, #18181b 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(to bottom, #18181b 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 50px 50px;\"></div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Ambient Glows -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 w-[600px] h-[600px] bg-blue-400/10 rounded-full blur-[100px] -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2\" style=\"transform: translateZ(10px);\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-[30%] left-[70%] w-[400px] h-[400px] bg-purple-400/10 rounded-full blur-[80px] -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2\" style=\"transform: translateZ(10px);\"></div>\n\n                    <!-- SVG Connection Lines -->\n                    <svg class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full z-10 overflow-visible\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 1000\" style=\"transform: translateZ(20px);\">\n                        <defs>\n                            <linearGradient id=\"flow-blue\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"100%\">\n                                <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#3b82f6\" stop-opacity=\"0.9\" />\n                                <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#8b5cf6\" stop-opacity=\"0.2\" />\n                            </linearGradient>\n                            <linearGradient id=\"flow-emerald\" x1=\"100%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"0%\" y2=\"100%\">\n                                <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#10b981\" stop-opacity=\"0.9\" />\n                                <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#10b981\" stop-opacity=\"0.1\" />\n                            </linearGradient>\n                            <filter id=\"glow\" x=\"-20%\" y=\"-20%\" width=\"140%\" height=\"140%\">\n                                <feGaussianBlur stdDeviation=\"6\" result=\"blur\" />\n                                <feMerge>\n                                    <feMergeNode in=\"blur\" />\n                                    <feMergeNode in=\"SourceGraphic\" />\n                                </feMerge>\n                            </filter>\n                        </defs>\n\n                        <!-- Static Background Paths -->\n                        <path d=\"M 500 500 L 250 250 M 500 500 L 750 300 M 500 500 L 300 800 M 500 500 L 800 750\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e4e4e7\" stroke-width=\"2\" />\n                        <path d=\"M 250 250 L 750 300 L 800 750 L 300 800 Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e4e4e7\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"8 8\" />\n\n                        <!-- Animated Flowing Paths -->\n                        <path class=\"animated-path\" d=\"M 250 250 L 500 500 L 750 300\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"url(#flow-blue)\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"20 40\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" filter=\"url(#glow)\" />\n                        <path class=\"animated-path-fast\" d=\"M 800 750 L 500 500 L 300 800\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"url(#flow-emerald)\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"15 60\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" filter=\"url(#glow)\" />\n                    </svg>\n\n                    <!-- HTML 3D Nodes (Positioned perfectly to match SVG coordinates) -->\n\n                    <!-- Center Core Node -->\n                    <div class=\"float-element absolute top-[50%] left-[50%] w-24 h-24 bg-white border border-zinc-200 shadow-[0_0_60px_rgba(255,255,255,1)] rounded-full -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 z-30 flex items-center justify-center\" style=\"transform: translateZ(60px);\">\n                        <div class=\"w-16 h-16 rounded-full border border-zinc-100 flex items-center justify-center animate-[spin_6s_linear_infinite]\">\n                            <div class=\"w-2 h-2 bg-zinc-900 rounded-full absolute -top-1 shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(24,24,27,0.5)]\"></div>\n                        </div>\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:database-linear\" class=\"text-zinc-900 text-3xl absolute\"></iconify-icon>\n                        <div class=\"absolute -bottom-8 whitespace-nowrap text-xs font-medium text-zinc-600 bg-white/80 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-zinc-200 shadow-sm backdrop-blur-md\">Core Engine</div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Node TL (250,250) -->\n                    <div class=\"float-element absolute top-[25%] left-[25%] w-6 h-6 bg-blue-500 rounded-full shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(59,130,246,0.8)] -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 z-20 flex items-center justify-center\" style=\"transform: translateZ(30px);\">\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 border border-blue-400 rounded-full animate-ping opacity-60\" style=\"animation-duration: 2.5s;\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"w-2 h-2 bg-white rounded-full\"></div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Node TR (750,300) -->\n                    <div class=\"float-element absolute top-[30%] left-[75%] w-4 h-4 bg-purple-500 rounded-full shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(168,85,247,0.8)] -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 z-20\" style=\"transform: translateZ(40px);\"></div>\n\n                    <!-- Node BL (300,800) -->\n                    <div class=\"float-element absolute top-[80%] left-[30%] w-8 h-8 bg-zinc-900 rounded-full shadow-[0_0_40px_rgba(24,24,27,0.6)] border border-zinc-700 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 z-20 flex items-center justify-center\" style=\"transform: translateZ(50px);\">\n                        <div class=\"w-3 h-3 bg-emerald-400 rounded-full shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(52,211,153,1)]\"></div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Node BR (800,750) -->\n                    <div class=\"float-element absolute top-[75%] left-[80%] w-5 h-5 bg-zinc-400 rounded-full shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(161,161,170,0.6)] border border-white -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 z-20\" style=\"transform: translateZ(25px);\"></div>\n\n                    <!-- Layered Floating Glass Cards -->\n\n                    <!-- Top Left Analytics Card -->\n                    <div class=\"float-element absolute top-[10%] left-[10%] w-[260px] bg-white/70 backdrop-blur-2xl border border-white/80 p-5 rounded-3xl shadow-[0_30px_60px_-15px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)] z-40\" style=\"transform: translateZ(120px);\">\n                        <div class=\"flex justify-between items-start mb-4\">\n                            <div>\n                                <div class=\"text-[0.65rem] font-bold text-zinc-400 tracking-wider uppercase mb-1\">Stream Rate</div>\n                                <div class=\"text-xl font-medium tracking-tight text-zinc-900\">42,891 <span class=\"text-xs text-zinc-500 font-normal\">req/s</span></div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-blue-50 text-blue-500 flex items-center justify-center border border-blue-100\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:chart-square-linear\" class=\"text-lg\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <!-- Mini Bar Chart -->\n                        <div class=\"flex items-end gap-[2px] h-10 w-full\">\n                            <div class=\"w-full bg-zinc-200 rounded-sm h-[30%]\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"w-full bg-zinc-200 rounded-sm h-[50%]\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"w-full bg-zinc-200 rounded-sm h-[40%]\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"w-full bg-blue-500 rounded-sm h-[80%] shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(59,130,246,0.5)]\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"w-full bg-zinc-200 rounded-sm h-[60%]\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"w-full bg-zinc-200 rounded-sm h-[90%]\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"w-full bg-zinc-200 rounded-sm h-[40%]\"></div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Bottom Right Auth Card -->\n                    <div class=\"float-element absolute top-[65%] left-[65%] w-[300px] bg-zinc-900/90 backdrop-blur-2xl border border-zinc-800 p-5 rounded-3xl shadow-[0_40px_80px_-20px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5)] z-40 flex flex-col gap-4\" style=\"transform: translateZ(150px);\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                            <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full overflow-hidden border border-zinc-700 shrink-0\">\n                                <!-- Aura Avatar Asset -->\n                                <img src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/0d868fef-f560-45ca-ab35-5dad4fc29059_3840w.webp\" alt=\"User Profile\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\">\n                            </div>\n                            <div>\n                                <div class=\"text-sm font-medium tracking-tight text-white flex items-center gap-1\">\n                                    Identity Verified\n                                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:check-circle-linear\" class=\"text-emerald-400\"></iconify-icon>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"text-xs text-zinc-400\">Node encryption path established</div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"h-[1px] w-full bg-gradient-to-r from-zinc-800 via-zinc-700 to-zinc-800\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center text-xs\">\n                            <span class=\"text-zinc-500\">Latency</span>\n                            <span class=\"text-emerald-400 font-medium\">1.2ms</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Floating Particles -->\n                    <div class=\"float-element absolute top-[40%] left-[15%] w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-blue-400 rounded-full shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(96,165,250,0.8)] z-30\" style=\"transform: translateZ(80px);\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"float-element absolute top-[20%] left-[60%] w-2 h-2 bg-purple-400 rounded-full shadow-[0_0_12px_rgba(192,132,252,0.8)] z-30\" style=\"transform: translateZ(140px);\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"float-element absolute top-[70%] left-[45%] w-1 h-1 bg-emerald-400 rounded-full shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(52,211,153,0.8)] z-30\" style=\"transform: translateZ(90px);\"></div>\n\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <!-- Asymmetrical Features Section (Breaking the Grid) -->\n    <section class=\"py-32 px-6 max-w-7xl mx-auto relative z-10\">\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-16 lg:gap-24\">\n\n            <!-- Sticky Left Column -->\n            <div class=\"lg:w-1/3 relative\">\n                <div class=\"sticky top-32\">\n                    <!-- Secondary Masked Reveal Trigger -->\n                    <h2 class=\"text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-medium tracking-tight text-zinc-900 mb-6 flex flex-wrap gap-x-[0.25em] gap-y-1 masked-reveal-trigger-2\">\n                        <span class=\"inline-flex overflow-hidden pb-1\"><span class=\"masked-word-2 translate-y-[110%] inline-block\">Architecture</span></span>\n                        <span class=\"inline-flex overflow-hidden pb-1\"><span class=\"masked-word-2 translate-y-[110%] inline-block\">without</span></span>\n                        <span class=\"inline-flex overflow-hidden pb-1\"><span class=\"masked-word-2 translate-y-[110%] text-zinc-400 inline-block\">compromise.</span></span>\n                    </h2>\n                    <p class=\"text-zinc-500 text-base leading-relaxed mb-8\">\n                        We completely bypassed traditional DOM rendering. By leveraging a hardware-accelerated hybrid layer, your entire schema runs with zero layout thrashing and perfect synchronicity.\n                    </p>\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-medium text-zinc-900 hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors group\">\n                        Explore the engine\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" class=\"transform group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Scrolling Right Column with Overlapping Elements -->\n            <div class=\"lg:w-2/3 relative flex flex-col gap-8 lg:gap-16 pt-10 lg:pt-0\">\n\n                <!-- Feature Card 1 -->\n                <div class=\"bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 shadow-2xl shadow-zinc-200/40 rounded-[2.5rem] p-8 lg:p-12 ml-0 lg:ml-12 transform hover:-translate-y-2 transition-transform duration-500 relative overflow-hidden group\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-64 h-64 bg-blue-50 rounded-full blur-3xl -translate-y-1/2 translate-x-1/3 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-700\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"relative z-10\">\n                        <div class=\"w-14 h-14 bg-zinc-50 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center border border-zinc-100 mb-8 shadow-sm\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:bolt-linear\" class=\"text-zinc-900 text-2xl\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                        <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-medium tracking-tight text-zinc-900 mb-4\">Sub-millisecond sync</h3>\n                        <p class=\"text-base text-zinc-500 leading-relaxed max-w-md\">\n                            Changes propagate across the global edge network instantly. Your visual schema is always an exact, mathematically precise mirror of your production database.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Feature Card 2 (Offset and Dark) -->\n                <div class=\"bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-800 shadow-2xl shadow-zinc-900/50 rounded-[2.5rem] p-8 lg:p-12 mr-0 lg:mr-12 transform hover:-translate-y-2 transition-transform duration-500 relative overflow-hidden group\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-64 h-64 bg-emerald-900/30 rounded-full blur-3xl translate-y-1/3 -translate-x-1/4 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-700\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"relative z-10\">\n                        <div class=\"w-14 h-14 bg-zinc-800 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center border border-zinc-700 mb-8 shadow-inner\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:shield-keyhole-linear\" class=\"text-white text-2xl\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                        <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-medium tracking-tight text-white mb-4\">Cryptographic integrity</h3>\n                        <p class=\"text-base text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed max-w-md\">\n                            Every node connection is verified via zero-knowledge proofs, ensuring your architecture remains untampered, mathematically sound, and isolated by default.\n                        </p>\n\n                        <!-- Custom Toggle UI included as part of the card design -->\n                        <div class=\"mt-8 flex items-center gap-4 bg-zinc-800/50 p-4 rounded-2xl border border-zinc-700/50 w-max\">\n                            <div class=\"flex flex-col\">\n                                <span class=\"text-sm font-medium text-white\">Strict Mode isolation</span>\n                                <span class=\"text-xs text-zinc-500\">Requires manual approval for mutations</span>\n                            </div>\n                            <button class=\"w-11 h-6 bg-emerald-500 rounded-full relative shadow-inner cursor-pointer\" aria-label=\"Toggle strict mode\">\n                                <div class=\"absolute right-1 top-1 w-4 h-4 bg-white rounded-full shadow-sm\"></div>\n                            </button>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Simple CTA & Footer -->\n    <section class=\"py-32 px-6 text-center\">\n        <h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-5xl font-medium tracking-tight text-zinc-900 mb-6\">Ready to see the unseen?</h2>\n        <p class=\"text-zinc-500 mb-10 max-w-xl mx-auto\">Deploy Nexus in your environment with a single configuration file. Integrates natively with Postgres, Redis, and your custom APIs.</p>\n        <button class=\"bg-zinc-900 text-white text-sm font-medium px-6 py-3 rounded-full hover:bg-zinc-800 transition-colors shadow-lg shadow-zinc-900/20\">\n            Initialize Workspace\n        </button>\n    </section>\n\n    <footer class=\"border-t border-zinc-200/60 py-10 px-6 text-center text-sm text-zinc-400\">\n        <p>&copy; 2026 Nexus Systems. Crafted with precision.</p>\n    </footer>\n\n    <!-- GSAP Animation Logic -->\n    <script>\n        document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", () => {\n            gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n            // 1. Initial Hero Masked Reveal\n            const heroWords = document.querySelectorAll('.masked-word');\n            if (heroWords.length > 0) {\n                gsap.to(heroWords, {\n                    y: \"0%\",\n                    duration: 1.2,\n                    stagger: 0.05,\n                    ease: \"power4.out\",\n                    delay: 0.2\n                });\n            }\n\n            // 2. Scroll-Triggered Masked Reveal\n            const scrollWords = document.querySelectorAll('.masked-word-2');\n            if (scrollWords.length > 0) {\n                gsap.to(scrollWords, {\n                    y: \"0%\",\n                    duration: 1.2,\n                    stagger: 0.05,\n                    ease: \"power4.out\",\n                    scrollTrigger: {\n                        trigger: \".masked-reveal-trigger-2\",\n                        start: \"top 85%\",\n                    }\n                });\n            }\n\n            // 3. SVG Path Data Flow Animations\n            gsap.to(\".animated-path\", {\n                strokeDashoffset: -60,\n                duration: 2.5,\n                repeat: -1,\n                ease: \"none\"\n            });\n            gsap.to(\".animated-path-fast\", {\n                strokeDashoffset: -75, // Adjust based on dasharray sum to make it seamless\n                duration: 1.5,\n                repeat: -1,\n                ease: \"none\"\n            });\n\n            // 4. Floating Elements (Nodes & Cards)\n            gsap.to(\".float-element\", {\n                z: \"+=15\",\n                y: \"-=8\",\n                duration: \"random(2.5, 4)\",\n                yoyo: true,\n                repeat: -1,\n                ease: \"sine.inOut\",\n                stagger: {\n                    amount: 2,\n                    from: \"random\"\n                }\n            });\n\n            // 5. Interactive Mouse Tilt Effect for the 3D Schema\n            const container = document.querySelector('.scene-container');\n            const plane = document.getElementById('schema-plane');\n\n            // Base rotation values set in HTML\n            const baseX = 60;\n            const baseZ = -45;\n\n            let targetRotateX = baseX;\n            let targetRotateZ = baseZ;\n            let currentRotateX = baseX;\n            let currentRotateZ = baseZ;\n\n            if (container && plane) {\n                container.addEventListener('mousemove', (e) => {\n                    const rect = container.getBoundingClientRect();\n                    // Calculate relative mouse position (-0.5 to 0.5)\n                    const x = (e.clientX - rect.left) / rect.width - 0.5;\n                    const y = (e.clientY - rect.top) / rect.height - 0.5;\n\n                    // Add subtle tilt based on mouse position\n                    targetRotateX = baseX + (y * -15); // Invert Y for natural feel\n                    targetRotateZ = baseZ + (x * 15);\n                });\n\n                container.addEventListener('mouseleave', () => {\n                    // Return to base rotation smoothly\n                    targetRotateX = baseX;\n                    targetRotateZ = baseZ;\n                });\n\n                // Smooth interpolation render loop (butter smooth compared to direct mousemove styling)\n                function renderTilt() {\n                    // Linear interpolation (lerp)\n                    currentRotateX += (targetRotateX - currentRotateX) * 0.05;\n                    currentRotateZ += (targetRotateZ - currentRotateZ) * 0.05;\n\n                    // Apply strictly to transform string\n                    plane.style.transform = `rotateX(${currentRotateX}deg) rotateZ(${currentRotateZ}deg)`;\n\n                    requestAnimationFrame(renderTilt);\n                }\n\n                // Start render loop\n                renderTilt();\n            }\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "dimensional-interface-schema.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/staff-featured-2026-05-22/dimensional-interface-schema.jpg", "source_name": "dimensional-interface-schema-DESIGN.md", "views": 247, "forks": 10, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "8bd0314a-9525-4a13-996e-2c37cbd9e514", "created_at": "2026-05-22T07:58:12.433844+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T17:34:02.256906+00:00"}